<title>UK: Sri Lanka sets $50 million three-year FRN, put.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka sets $50 million three-year FRN, put.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Citibank International and ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SRI LANKA</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  * 03.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +150 BP   PAY DATE    03.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   1.00</p>
<p> NOTES    * PUT AT PAR ON 05.APR.99</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SRI LANKA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
